cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FeCIM Lattice Tools, cite this software and record the exact
  Git commit and study artifacts used. Release and DOI metadata will be
  added only after publication.
type: software
title: FeCIM Lattice Tools
abstract: >-
  A simulation-only research and design workbench for ferroelectric
  compute-in-memory systems, with deterministic parameter sweeps,
  provenance-aware results, and local desktop workspaces.
authors:
